Kernel fixtures

fx_triton_transform_floor_grid and fx_triton_transform_ceil_grid are Pomset
fixtures distributed under Apache-2.0. Their fixture.json files record their
origin, declared outcomes and relationship.

The floor-grid fixture is a reconstruction of an output-coverage failure
pattern, with research context at https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/9230.
It is not the upstream reproducer and does not reproduce the issue's complete
autotune/buffer-reuse behavior. The ceiling-grid fixture is its control.

Design references

The local inspo/ and dont-track/ directories are excluded from distribution.
Compiler Explorer is an interaction reference, not a bundled implementation.
Third-party runtime dependencies retain their own licenses in their packages.
